          },
          shortDescription: "Donkey (known as 'Kazhuda' in Tamil/Malayalam or 'Gaadida' in Telugu) is a popular shedding card game played in South India. Unlike many Western card games where winning a trick is desirable, in Donkey, the goal is simply to get rid of your cards. Failing to follow suit results in the 'Donkey' penalty: taking all the cards from the current trick into your hand.",
